@startuml RandomProviderNetwork
!include ../style.puml

title Random Provider Network Architecture - Commit-Reveal Protocol

package "Provider Network" {
    component "Provider A" as ProviderA <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider B" as ProviderB <<RandomProvider>>
    component "Provider C" as ProviderC <<RandomProvider>>
}

package "Whisper Network" {
    component "Whisper Network" as WhisperNet
}

package "Blockchain" {
    component "Contract Instance" as ContractInstance <<IRandomContract>>
}

' COMMIT PHASE - Whisper Network Socialization
ProviderA -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : **COMMIT PHASE**\nshare commitments
ProviderB -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : share commitments  
ProviderC -[#FF9900]-> WhisperNet : share commitments

WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderA : broadcast commitments
WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderB : broadcast commitments
WhisperNet .[#FF9900].> ProviderC : broadcast commitments

' COMMIT PHASE - Blockchain Posting
ProviderA -[#FF9900]-> ContractInstance : **1. commit()**\npost commitments
ProviderB -[#FF9900]-> ContractInstance : commit()
ProviderC -[#FF9900]-> ContractInstance : commit()

' REVEAL PHASE - Whisper Network Socialization  
ProviderA -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : **REVEAL PHASE**\nshare secrets
ProviderB -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : share secrets
ProviderC -[#4682B4]-> WhisperNet : share secrets

WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderA : broadcast secrets
WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderB : broadcast secrets  
WhisperNet .[#4682B4].> ProviderC : broadcast secrets

' REVEAL PHASE - Blockchain Posting
ProviderA -[#4682B4]-> ContractInstance : **2. reveal()**\npost secrets
ProviderB -[#4682B4]-> ContractInstance : reveal()
ProviderC -[#4682B4]-> ContractInstance : reveal()

note right of WhisperNet
  **Whisper Network**
  
  **Phase 1 (Orange)**: Commitments
  **Phase 2 (Blue)**: Secrets
  
  Secure P2P socialization
  before blockchain posting
end note

note bottom of ContractInstance
  **Smart Contract**
  
  **Phase 1**: Receive commitments
  **Phase 2**: Receive reveals & 
  generate final entropy
end note

@enduml